wayvnc: wayvnc (VNC server for wlroots-based Wayland compositors)
wayvnc:
wayvnc: wayvnc is a VNC server for wlroots-based Wayland compositors. It
wayvnc: attaches to a running Wayland session, creates virtual input devices,
wayvnc: and exposes a display via the RFB (VNC) protocol.
wayvnc:
wayvnc: It supports screencopy, GPU-side dmabuf capture, multiple outputs,
wayvnc: TLS/VeNCrypt via neatvnc, PAM authentication, and a control socket
wayvnc: (wayvncctl) for runtime configuration.
wayvnc: Homepage: https://github.com/any1/wayvnc
